<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title></title>
</head>
<body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Transdisciplinair onderwijs vraagt om andere leeractiviteiten en werkvormen dan je misschien gewend bent. Het leren vindt plaats in de samenwerking – met de samenleving, met andere disciplines, en met jezelf.</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Een belangrijk kenmerk van transdisciplinair</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> onderwijs is </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">het integreren van verschillende perspectieven</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">: wetenschappelijke, professionele, ervaringsgerichte én maatschappelijke inzichten worden bij elkaar gebracht. Dat integratieproces gebeurt in co-creatie: </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">in de samenwerking tussen studenten en andere betrokkenen</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">We spreken dan van </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">collaboratieve integratie</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">. Studenten brengen elk hun eigen kennis en achtergrond in – bijvoorbeeld vanuit hun opleiding of persoonlijke ervaring – en werken samen aan het ontwikkelen van gedeelde inzichten, oplossingen of producten (<span style="margin: 0px">Oudenampsen</span></span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> et al., 2024)&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Vijf integratieve onderwijsmethoden (Lambalgen &amp; van der Tuin, 2024)&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Om collaboratieve integratie bewust te begeleiden, kun je gebruik maken van integratieve onderwijsmethoden. Dit zijn onderwijsstrategieën die studenten helpen om samen verschillende perspectieven te verbinden.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"></span><a style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 0px" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2yGe6GP1Bw4"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Interdisciplinaire Integratietechnieken - YouTube</span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><table aria-rowcount="6" data-clean-table="1" style="border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Methode</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Focus van integratie</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Interdisciplinary Research </span><span style="margin: 0px">Process&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Disciplinaire inzichten via common ground</span>&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Travelling </span><span style="margin: 0px">Concepts</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Verschillende conceptuele brillen&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Design Thinking</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Probleem- en oplossingsgerichte integratie&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Object Orientation</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Analyse &amp; herintegratie van een object&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Systems Thinking</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #ffffff; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Systeemniveaus en interacties&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Elke methode ondersteunt andere leeruitkomsten – kies wat past bij de leerdoelen, de context en de studentengroep.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px">Meer informatie</span><span style="margin: 0px"> over de methode</span><span style="margin: 0px"> vind</span><span style="margin: 0px"> je hier</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">: </span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"></span><a style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: 0px" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.elgaronline.com/edcollchap-oa/book/9781035309870/book-part-9781035309870-16.xml"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px">Chapter 7: Teaching integration in: Handbook of Interdisciplinary Teaching and Administration</span></span></span></a><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Bronnen:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px">van Lambalgen</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">, R., &amp; van der Tuin, I. (2024). Teaching integration. In: </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">Handbook of interdisciplinary teaching and administration</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"> (pp. 114-135). Edward Elgar Publishing.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px"></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="EN-US"><span style="margin: 0px">Oudenampsen, J., Das, E., </span><span style="margin: 0px">Blijlevens, N., &amp; van de Pol, M. H. (2024). The state of the empirical evidence for interdisciplinary learning outcomes in higher education: A systematic review. The Review of Higher Education, 47(4), 467-518.</span>&nbsp;</span></p></body>
</html>